{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14103080","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14103080","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1410308001:0":{"text":"立ち止まれ。私はエクシルの警備隊長、インドラだ。","source_cn":"你们几个，站住。我乃因度厄，艾塞勒一族的卫队长。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x84BFB6506CD03604","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1410308002:1":{"text":"厄化は我々一族の禁秘。それを見たお前たちを、このまま行かせるわけにはいかん。","source_cn":"你们参与了对孽化者的处理，此事涉及我族秘辛，我不能放你们走。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B9E7E5BC9FCB94","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1410308003:1":{"text":"その禁秘ってのは、アリタがオレたちの前でモンスターになったことか？","source_cn":"你说的秘辛，是指那孩子在我们眼前变成了怪物？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x43AAB08EC0660485","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1410308004:0":{"text":"あれと似たモンスターを見たことがある。てっきり珍しい地下生物か何かだと思ってたが……元はエクシルだったのか？","source_cn":"我曾见过那种怪物，我还以为是什么稀有的地下物种。难道…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93AE50893B5CE8FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1410308005:1":{"text":"……私からは何も言えないが、関わってしまった以上――","source_cn":"……我不便透露。但你们牵涉到了其中——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA5EDD985C7A5E93E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1410308006:1":{"text":"お前たちを<style=\"highlight\">サロクディア</style>へ連れて行き、大司祭様の判断を仰ぐ必要がある。","source_cn":"必须随我去<style=highlight>萨洛克兰<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDB0A7B93A0A3AE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1410308007:1":{"text":"そんな、勝手に決めないでください！","source_cn":"这么可疑的要求，我们才不会跟你走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x38D338E3298A045C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1410308008:1":{"text":"面倒なことになりたくなければ、大人しくついてこい。","source_cn":"不要让事情变得复杂，我不想动手。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2920BA75B502804A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1410308009:0":{"text":"なんですか偉そうに！こっちは四人いるんですよ！","source_cn":"喂，你什么口气啊……我们这里可是有4个人！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68339A908C9D5072","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1410308010:1":{"text":"力ずくで来るつもりか？","source_cn":"所以你们选择用武力解决问题？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7988509E87453554","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1410308011:1":{"text":"ストップストーップ！兄ちゃん今<style=\"highlight\">サロクディア</style>って言ったか？","source_cn":"停——这位小哥，你刚才说，要带我们去<style=hi...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2CAFB19C396F3FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:14:1410308011":{"text":"ストップストーップ！兄ちゃん今<style=\"highlight\">サロクディア</style>って言ったか？","source_cn":"停——这位小哥，你刚才说，要带我们去<style=highlight>萨洛克兰</style>？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2CAFB19C396F3FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1410308012:0":{"text":"我々一族が暮らしている場所だ。争いや苦しみのない、穢れなき楽園、それがサロクディアだ。","source_cn":"我族居住的地方名为萨洛克兰。那是远离纷争、痛苦和污秽的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F108D3A20C732D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1410308013:1":{"text":"心配することはない、あくまでも形式的なものだ。大司祭様はとても寛容なお方だからな。","source_cn":"我也是例行公事，你们无需紧张。祭司冕下宽容慈爱……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCDA50F873FF980A2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1410308014:1":{"text":"それに、ドワーフ一族が我々に果たしてきた役割を思えば、きっと悪いようにはしないはずだ。","source_cn":"再加上矮人一族为我族做出的特殊贡献，她绝不会刁难你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB08E1D158FD95337","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1410308014":{"text":"それに、ドワーフ一族が我々に果たしてきた役割を思えば、きっと悪いようにはしないはずだ。","source_cn":"再加上矮人一族为我族做出的特殊贡献，她绝不会刁难你们。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB08E1D158FD95337","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1410308015:0":{"text":"す、少し話し合いたいから、ちょっと待っててくれるか、インドラの兄ちゃん。","source_cn":"因、因度厄小哥，你稍等，我们商量商量。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3510254A90960626","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1410308016:1":{"text":"いいだろう。そこで待っている。逃げようなんて考えるなよ。","source_cn":"可以，我在一旁等候。别想着逃跑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x119CE0D23CCF481C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:23:1410308017:0":{"text":"インドラは少し距離を取ったものの、その視線はなおもこちらをしっかりと捉えていた……","source_cn":"因度厄走远了几步，他的双眼仍然紧紧锁视着众人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6628634B48723FDF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1410308018:0":{"text":"実を言うとな、サロクディアには<style=\"highlight\">地上へ通じる昇降機</style>があって、オレもそこへ行くつもりだったんだ。","source_cn":"<style=stress><player_name>...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x9BCB87CF9D0B5F6A","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"実を言うとな、サロクディアには<style=\"highlight\">地上へ通じる昇降機</style>があって、オレもそこへ行くつもりだったんだ。","female":"実を言うとな、サロクディアには<style=\"highlight\">地上へ通じる昇降機</style>があって、オレもそこへ行くつもりだったんだ。","variant_male_record_index":"156826","variant_female_record_index":"156827","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1410308019:1":{"text":"……それって本当なんですか？","source_cn":"祖娅……我不确定该不该相信你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5335AE47AAA6705","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1410308020:0":{"text":"マスターも聞きましたよね。インドラさんは、<style=\"highlight\">ドワーフ一族がエクシルに果たしてきた役割</style>って言ってました。","source_cn":"你们肯定听到了，那位因度厄先生说<style=high...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x89E43D2BA6488328","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1410308021:1":{"text":"ロンロンも聞いたよ！","source_cn":"满满也听到了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAFDB482018F99A39","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1410308022:1":{"text":"ゾーヤさんの反応も変でしたし。何も知らないとは言わせませんよ。","source_cn":"祖娅，刚才看你的表情，你肯定知道些什么。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA801CF3D453B3C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:30:1410308023:1":{"text":"あなた方の関係や、私たちがここに落ちた理由を、ちゃんと説明してくれない限り、あなたを信用できません！","source_cn":"你们之间的关系，还有我们掉落下来这一系列事情，如果不解...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7FEE47785B99DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:31:1410308023":{"text":"あなた方の関係や、私たちがここに落ちた理由を、ちゃんと説明してくれない限り、あなたを信用できません！","source_cn":"你们之间的关系，还有我们掉落下来这一系列事情，如果不解释清楚，我们很难相信你！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD7FEE47785B99DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1410308024:0":{"text":"アンタも特使だって？一体ブライトから何人特使が来てるんだ？","source_cn":"耀光来的？地表上那群矮人到底做了什么啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1210A06C9F941615","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1410308025:0":{"text":"ったく、上の奴らは何をしたんだよ……","source_cn":"怎么把你们惹过来了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x430897195E6678F6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1410308027:0":{"text":"とにかく、アンタらが思ってるようなことじゃないのは保証する！全部は言えないけど、それだけは間違いない！","source_cn":"总之，我先保证，一切跟你们想的都不一样！有些东西我不能...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF12037713F9413E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1410308028:1":{"text":"エクシルたちが暮らしている王都サロクディアは、オレらの同胞が建てたんだ。","source_cn":"萨洛克兰，艾塞勒生活的那座王城，是我的同胞们所建。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x45927F077BB143A9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1410308029:1":{"text":"え、ドワーフたちが？エクシルとそんなに親しかったんですか？","source_cn":"哎？竟然是矮人建的吗？你们两个族群的关系这么密切！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF7D924F98EF7B96F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1410308030:1":{"text":"違う違う！そもそも、ドワーフはブライト中の建設に関わってたからな。","source_cn":"不至于不至于！这算不上大事。整个耀光的建设都离不开我的同族。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C47A79DDAC0758C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1410308031:1":{"text":"千年前にどっかの橋を作ったとか、八百年前に誰かと協力して川を掘ったとか――","source_cn":"什么一千年前在东边帮人家造过桥，八百年前在西边帮人家挖...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B08E7ABB005FCBB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1410308032:1":{"text":"だから三百年前に地下で街を建てたことも、オレらにとってはわざわざ言う必要もない些細な事なんだよ。","source_cn":"三百年前在地底下帮人家盖个房子，这种没有什么技术含量的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x26742E050AA4D666","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1410308033:1":{"text":"だったら、どうして最初から言ってくれなかったんです？","source_cn":"既然如此，为什么你支支吾吾的？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98F2B497223B6B60","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","docu